1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,200
[Hotel PAL]

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:09,000
Haru, I...

3
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:16,840
I'm sorry.

4
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:23,270
I got ahead of myself.

5
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:27,650
A weird switch flipped in me.

6
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:30,440
I can't believe I was so giddy about this.

7
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:34,670
I'm so sorry I led you on.

8
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:38,040
Please, don't apologize.

9
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:45,020
I was waiting for that switch to flip.

10
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:51,560
You only ever saw me as a coworker.

11
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:55,910
But to me, you were special.

12
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:59,620
And then you suddenly got married.

13
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:06,010
Truthfully, part of me always hoped
a day like this would come.

14
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,000
I'm sorry I took advantage
of your momentary hesitation.

15
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:21,210
You're a creator I respect, Shibuya.
That hasn't ever changed.

16
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:28,380
Good luck writing those extra 100 pages.

17
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,730
Is now really the time?

18
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,700
<i>Just got back to my hotel.</i>

19
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:47,710
<i>Our boys' trip is going great.</i>

20
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:50,000
<i>Hope you had a good day.</i>

21
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:56,360
What am I doing?

22
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:56,640
[Episode 11]

23
00:02:57,850 --> 00:03:03,270
You almost had sex with a coworker?

24
00:03:03,270 --> 00:03:05,000
You, Haru?

25
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,090
The late blooming stalker?

26
00:03:07,090 --> 00:03:09,330
Don't poke at my dark past.

27
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:12,080
I'm just impressed by the evolution.

28
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:16,150
- Have I really "evolved"?
- Huh?

29
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:19,320
I went from fussy-stalker, to wife.

30
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:21,900
From pent up, to relieved.

31
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:26,010
And as a result, I got way ahead of myself.

32
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:31,800
When you put it that way,
it sounds more like you regressed.

33
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:38,180
Before, you were more earnest about Ouji.

34
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:40,520
You think so, too?

35
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,100
It's tough, isn't it?

36
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:49,750
Even when you're honest with yourself,
you don't know what's right.

37
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:53,130
You lose sight of what's important.

38
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:56,050
And ultimately, you spiral all over again.

39
00:03:58,310 --> 00:04:00,120
Ugh.

40
00:04:01,740 --> 00:04:04,940
- I wanna disappear.
- Huh?

41
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:07,240
I couldn't hold myself back.

42
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,810
I said something super clingy to Naoki.

43
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:11,870
You did?

44
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:17,940
I thought I'd never understand people
who were swayed by love.

45
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:21,020
But at this rate, he'll only hate me.

46
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:28,140
I'm scared. I don't want him to hate me.

47
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,910
It's like...

48
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:38,210
It's like I'm losing myself.

49
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:40,860
It hurts.

50
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:45,190
Of course you're scared.

51
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:51,590
I was, too.

52
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:57,210
I didn't want Ouji to hate me.

53
00:04:57,210 --> 00:05:01,670
So I thought I'd keep everything to myself.

54
00:05:01,670 --> 00:05:04,190
But that was difficult.

55
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:07,850
Eventually, I exploded.

56
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:16,010
Maybe that's why I regressed at all.

57
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:23,300
It did make me feel a bit better, though.

58
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:28,820
Except, now I'm more confused.

59
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:31,680
Maybe I'm not as earnest anymore.

60
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:37,360
And I don't exactly know
what I want in my future, but...

61
00:05:42,250 --> 00:05:44,500
I'm chugging this.

62
00:05:50,330 --> 00:05:52,020
I...

63
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,420
I'm going to go confess, right now.

64
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:56,640
- Huh?
- What?

65
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:59,120
It's something I need to do,
so I don't lose myself.

66
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:05,620
I want his body and heart to be all mine.

67
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:19,150
Watching this is even more nerve-wracking...

68
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,940
He's here.

69
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,680
Akina!

70
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:31,400
Long time no see. Thanks for calling me.

71
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:34,150
No, thank you for coming on short notice.

72
00:06:34,150 --> 00:06:35,650
It's no problem.

73
00:06:37,710 --> 00:06:42,170
I'm sorry for the other night.

74
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:44,900
I know it must've been awkward.

75
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,880
I got so depressed on you.

76
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:49,860
You must think I'm crazy, right?

77
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:55,520
With the amount of intimacy
we've experienced,

78
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:59,960
it's only natural to want more.

79
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:03,390
But...

80
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:09,770
It's against the business contract, right?

81
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,330
Sorry.

82
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:17,020
Naoki.

83
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:21,640
I'm sure you can already tell, but...

84
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:27,630
I...

85
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:32,470
I love you.

86
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:39,590
I've never loved another person before.

87
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:44,840
I've never felt so obsessed.

88
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:51,080
I've never felt so jealous.

89
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:59,950
It all makes me hate myself.

90
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,910
But...

91
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,200
Right now...

92
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,980
I'm just glad you're here.

93
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:23,240
Thank you.

94
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:31,000
I also love you, Akina.

95
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:38,370
But I have to be honest.

96
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:42,370
I'm polyamorous.

97
00:08:42,370 --> 00:08:44,610
Polyamorous?

98
00:08:44,610 --> 00:08:50,300
I've always felt obliged to reply
to anyone who's showed me love.

99
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:54,620
No matter how many partners I may have.

100
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:59,800
It's hurt many people I've come to know.

101
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:06,360
I apologize for causing you such pain.

102
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:13,750
I love you.

103
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:17,700
I love you.

104
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:19,410
It doesn't hurt.

105
00:09:19,410 --> 00:09:21,290
I love you.

106
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:25,710
I love you.

107
00:09:27,350 --> 00:09:28,900
I love you.

108
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,810
I love you.

109
00:09:30,810 --> 00:09:32,750
I love you.

110
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:30,210
Drinking the night away
while I put our daughter to bed, huh?

111
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,340
Toshiki.

112
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:39,550
We need to talk.

113
00:11:13,070 --> 00:11:14,640
What's up?

114
00:11:16,090 --> 00:11:18,590
I was reminiscing.

115
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,320
About what?

116
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:25,130
About when we first met.

117
00:11:25,130 --> 00:11:27,970
Even though our feelings were mutual,

118
00:11:27,970 --> 00:11:33,960
you were always especially considerate of me.

119
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:49,090
Because sex chose to give me another chance,

120
00:11:49,090 --> 00:11:53,280
I felt like I had to take that opportunity
while I could.

121
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:55,080
Really?

122
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:59,770
Shota.

123
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:05,090
You taught me to treasure myself.

124
00:12:05,090 --> 00:12:06,940
Thank you.

125
00:12:09,590 --> 00:12:17,690
You've changed me for the better, too.

126
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:22,720
I'm counting on you for my next shoot, okay?

127
00:12:25,350 --> 00:12:27,990
Don't worry, I'll do my job.

128
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,470
But...

129
00:12:35,350 --> 00:12:37,710
This has to end.

130
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:47,070
"Just as life has no happy ending,"

131
00:12:47,070 --> 00:12:53,240
"the explorations of love and sex
do not last forever."

132
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,580
What do you think?

133
00:12:57,580 --> 00:13:03,210
It's as though you're denouncing
the sexual adventure

134
00:13:03,210 --> 00:13:05,700
your protagonist had in the main story.

135
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:09,730
That wasn't my intent.
She's just faced with reality.

136
00:13:09,730 --> 00:13:11,330
Reality?

137
00:13:11,330 --> 00:13:15,660
After witnessing the outcome
of her friends' journeys,

138
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:18,460
she once again considers
how she wants her story to end.

139
00:13:18,460 --> 00:13:20,450
How indecisive.

140
00:13:20,450 --> 00:13:24,870
It feels perfectly in character
for this protagonist.

141
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:26,740
You may be right.

142
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:29,550
Okay, finish this draft to its end.

143
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:31,690
Yes, ma'am.

144
00:13:31,690 --> 00:13:33,720
Let's wrap it up early.

145
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:36,690
You're going to the Suffragette's
reunion concert, right?

146
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:39,790
Yes.

147
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:50,420
Are you still undecided?

148
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:53,950
- Huh?
- About attending.

149
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:59,980
No. I'm going.

150
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,180
How could I not?

151
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:05,950
If you're so unsure,

152
00:14:06,750 --> 00:14:08,840
why not stay here, with me?

153
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:13,430
- Huh?
- The exploration of love and sex.

154
00:14:15,190 --> 00:14:17,810
It doesn't last forever, right?

155
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,850
Well...

156
00:14:20,850 --> 00:14:24,650
You may fall out of love
with your husband one day, too.

157
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:28,010
So why not end it here,

158
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:31,870
and start a new journey, with me?

159
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,680
I...

160
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:42,600
Do you not want it to end?

161
00:14:53,950 --> 00:14:57,800
<i>I love you, Haru.</i>

162
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:07,070
No, I don't.

163
00:15:11,580 --> 00:15:14,540
Despite everything...

164
00:15:15,330 --> 00:15:19,420
I love Ouji.

165
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,570
I'm sorry.

166
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:27,880
I knew that already.

167
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,720
Huh?

168
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:36,010
You're the only one who doesn't.

169
00:15:43,450 --> 00:15:45,210
Thank you.

170
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:50,430
Enjoy the concert.

171
00:15:51,940 --> 00:15:53,780
I will.

172
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:08,020
I always... always knew.

173
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:17,020
<i>Why? Since when had I become so confused?</i>

174
00:16:18,510 --> 00:16:24,020
<i>My feelings for him have never changed.</i>

175
00:16:24,890 --> 00:16:27,840
<i>Not since the day we first met.</i>

176
00:16:30,050 --> 00:16:33,660
<i>It's so easy. Ouji, I...</i>

177
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,730
[Suffragette City - REBIRTH, 2026]

178
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:53,640
Aizawa?

179
00:16:55,310 --> 00:16:58,020
Right, of course you'd come watch.

180
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:00,400
It's their reunion concert.

181
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:05,520
This is your first time attending a concert
as Ouji's wife, right?

182
00:17:06,190 --> 00:17:07,980
Congrats.

183
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:18,840
Can we talk?

184
00:17:20,110 --> 00:17:22,420
[Secrets]

185
00:17:23,530 --> 00:17:24,950
We're almost up.

186
00:17:24,950 --> 00:17:26,940
Is Haru coming?

187
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:30,860
Yeah. She never mentioned when, though.

188
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:32,800
Hope she makes it in time.

189
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:35,110
Yeah.

190
00:17:36,450 --> 00:17:39,780
Please, explain. What is going on here?

191
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:43,230
Well...

192
00:17:44,150 --> 00:17:46,340
What did Ouji say?

193
00:17:47,730 --> 00:17:51,870
My husband said nothing.

194
00:17:51,870 --> 00:17:53,770
Excuse me?

195
00:17:53,770 --> 00:17:57,380
That good-for-nothing wimp.

196
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:04,080
I admit, I wanted to ruffle your feathers.

197
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,010
What?

198
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:10,980
But I only wanted to add a bit of spice.
Like a good curry.

199
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,940
Then, this was...

200
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:15,700
What do you think happened?

201
00:18:16,330 --> 00:18:20,240
What would you do if he had cheated on you?

202
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:27,380
I wouldn't have done a thing.

203
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:31,470
Marriage doesn't make him my property.

204
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:36,870
I only wished to know the truth.

205
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:46,230
You've changed.

206
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:52,010
Of course we didn't do anything!
Not like we ever could.

207
00:18:52,010 --> 00:18:53,370
- Huh?
- You already know, right?

208
00:18:53,370 --> 00:18:58,800
I told him marriage wouldn't work
if he continued to hide his ED.

209
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:01,880
And just when I thought
we'd have a thrilling reunion,

210
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:07,420
he goes on and on
about his newlywed life and sex woes.

211
00:19:07,420 --> 00:19:11,460
I don't know how to treat a girl
who used to be a fan.

212
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:16,340
But I can tell it's been rough on her.

213
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:21,970
Ouji went to you for advice...

214
00:19:22,630 --> 00:19:23,850
About me?

215
00:19:23,850 --> 00:19:26,530
He was seriously so annoying.

216
00:19:26,530 --> 00:19:31,110
But I enjoyed the thrill
of not being a mother for once.

217
00:19:31,110 --> 00:19:34,930
Can you blame me for being a little mean?

218
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:37,740
The concert is about to begin.

219
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:40,370
Thank you. We'll be right there.

220
00:20:04,860 --> 00:20:10,520
♪ <i>Embracing warm moments together</i> ♪

221
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:17,860
♪ <i>Your laugh is beautiful, yet sorrowful</i> ♪

222
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:23,570
♪ <i>The thoughtless words I spill</i> ♪

223
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:30,040
♪ <i>Make your tears bitter, yet sweet</i> ♪

224
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:36,490
♪ <i>Why is it I long for your profile?</i> ♪

225
00:20:36,490 --> 00:20:42,990
♪ <i>Why is it I chase your fading shadow?</i> ♪

226
00:20:42,990 --> 00:20:49,500
♪ <i>Why is it? Why can't I smile?</i> ♪

227
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:55,130
♪ <i>I always knew I was a lame guy</i> ♪

228
00:20:55,130 --> 00:21:02,060
♪ <i>I had nothing to offer,
yet you stayed at my side</i> ♪

229
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:10,090
♪ <i>Because we called that happiness</i> ♪

230
00:21:10,090 --> 00:21:15,050
♪ <i>A gift you bestowed to me</i> ♪

231
00:21:15,050 --> 00:21:27,160
♪ <i>I love you, I love you so</i> ♪

232
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:34,030
♪ <i>I always knew I do</i> ♪

233
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,780
Haru.

234
00:22:02,660 --> 00:22:05,040
Weren't you in the middle of an after-party?

235
00:22:05,040 --> 00:22:09,000
It's fine. I've raised a toast with the guys.

236
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,030
The party will last all night anyway.

237
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:13,680
So? How was the concert?

238
00:22:14,380 --> 00:22:16,420
It was amazing.

239
00:22:16,420 --> 00:22:19,240
I liked your new song, too. It felt sincere.

240
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:23,030
Seriously? Your compliment
means the most to me.

241
00:22:23,030 --> 00:22:24,220
Huh?

242
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:27,900
You're an old, dedicated fan.

243
00:22:27,900 --> 00:22:30,890
Of course I'd want to hear your thoughts.

244
00:22:30,890 --> 00:22:33,180
I'm glad you liked it.

245
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:43,260
I'm a long-time fan.

246
00:22:44,020 --> 00:22:46,940
You're always within arm's reach.

247
00:22:48,610 --> 00:22:51,820
I'm allowed to monopolize your smiles.

248
00:22:53,300 --> 00:22:57,950
My old self would be so jealous of me now.

249
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,490
Except...

250
00:23:04,770 --> 00:23:07,010
Ouji.

251
00:23:08,840 --> 00:23:14,180
I've changed. You've noticed, right?

252
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:18,410
Yeah. But I'm fine...

253
00:23:18,410 --> 00:23:21,420
I know. I wasn't going to bring it up either.

254
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,430
Ouji.

255
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:42,010
I had sex with another man.

256
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:48,850
I have no right to be your wife.

257
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:58,700
[Preview]

